  "title": "Completion-event review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Completion-event review</h2><p>Evaluate four findings before issuing a nonissuer audit report.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f1\">Evaluate event A as evidence of</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"A condition existing at year-end\">A condition existing at year-end</option><option value=\"Only a new February condition\">Only a new February condition</option><option value=\"No relevant audit fact\">No relevant audit fact</option><option value=\"An automatic tax election\">An automatic tax election</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f2\">Ordinary treatment considered for event B</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Disclosure of a material new condition\">Disclosure of a material new condition</option><option value=\"Automatic year-end adjustment in every case\">Automatic year-end adjustment in every case</option><option value=\"No disclosure under any circumstances\">No disclosure under any circumstances</option><option value=\"A prior-year payroll expense\">A prior-year payroll expense</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f3\">Required work for C</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f3\"><option value=\"Evaluate feasibility and corroborating evidence\">Evaluate feasibility and corroborating evidence</option><option value=\"Accept intent as sufficient\">Accept intent as sufficient</option><option value=\"Guarantee success\">Guarantee success</option><option value=\"Ignore financing uncertainty\">Ignore financing uncertainty</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f4\">Response to D</label><select id=\"aud-m4-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Obtain the necessary bank evidence\">Obtain the necessary bank evidence</option><option value=\"Replace all evidence with representations\">Replace all evidence with representations</option><option value=\"Assume written words eliminate audit risk\">Assume written words eliminate audit risk</option><option value=\"Exclude cash from the opinion\">Exclude cash from the opinion</option></select></div></section>",
