      "title": "Events and representations",
      "html": "<p>A: A January bankruptcy corroborates a debtor’s year-end distress. B: A February storm causes a new material loss. C: Management’s only refinancing plan has no lender support. D: Management offers a representation instead of available bank evidence.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aud-m4-tbs2-ex2",
      "title": "Scope",
      "html": "<p>Assume the reporting framework requires recognition for evidence of existing conditions and disclosure of material new conditions. Evaluate the evidence and accounting implications before selecting an opinion.</p>"
    }
