  "explanation": "<h3>Evaluate event A as evidence of</h3><p>The bankruptcy corroborates prior distress.</p><h3>Ordinary treatment considered for event B</h3><p>A new condition can be a material nonrecognized subsequent event.</p><h3>Required work for C</h3><p>Plans must be supported and feasible.</p><h3>Response to D</h3><p>Representations supplement rather than replace necessary evidence.</p>"
